      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `embed_text.py` that generates an embedding vector for one text string using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to foundation models from Amazon and its partners. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library to interact with the Bedrock service and use a specific model identifier for the embedding task. </thinking>\n",
